- Official project materials, website, and documentation.

You may not:
- Claim to be the original creator or owner of LoadEngine.
- Register or use confusingly similar names, domains, or branding to impersonate the official project.
- Present an unofficial fork or derivative work as the official LoadEngine product.
- Use the official LoadEngine logo or branding to imply official endorsement or partnership without written permission.

7. Acceptable Use and Prohibition of Misuse

You may not use LoadEngine to develop, distribute, or facilitate:
- Malware, spyware, ransomware, or any malicious software.
- Illegal content, unlawful surveillance, or activities that violate applicable local, national, or international laws.
- Any software designed to infringe upon the intellectual property, privacy, or legal rights of others.

Any misuse of the engine or violation of this section constitutes an immediate breach of this license.

